---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<MainLayout title="About | YOUR BUSINESS NAME" description="Learn about the approach behind YOUR BUSINESS NAME and our practical, thoughtful way of working.">
	<section class="border-b border-[var(--line)] bg-white"><div class="container grid gap-12 py-20 md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] md:items-end md:py-28"><p class="eyebrow">About us</p><h1 class="display max-w-3xl text-5xl leading-none sm:text-7xl">Useful work deserves thoughtful attention.</h1></div></section>
	<section class="container grid gap-12 py-20 md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] md:py-28"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p></div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="display text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">We believe progress gets easier when the path is clear and the partnership is genuine.</p><p class="mt-7 leading-8 text-[var(--muted)]">YOUR BUSINESS NAME was created for people who care deeply about doing things well, but do not need more noise in their day. We listen carefully, ask direct questions, and bring structure to the places where good intentions need a little more support.</p><p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-[var(--muted)]">The result is work that feels grounded, useful, and built to last beyond the first conversation.</p></div></section>
	<section class="border-y border-[var(--line)] bg-[#dfeee9]"><div class="container grid gap-8 py-20 sm:grid-cols-3 md:py-24"><div><p class="display text-4xl">Listen</p><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">We begin with the real context, not an assumed solution.</p></div><div><p class="display text-4xl">Simplify</p><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">We turn complexity into decisions, systems, and clear next actions.</p></div><div><p class="display text-4xl">Follow through</p><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]">We stay accountable to the outcome, not just the recommendation.</p></div></div></section>
	<section class="container py-20 text-center md:py-28"><p class="eyebrow">A good place to begin</p><h2 class="display mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Bring us the question you keep circling.</h2><a class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full bg-[var(--teal)] px-6 py-4 font-bold text-white hover:bg-[var(--teal-dark)]" href={`${base}/contact`}>Start a conversation</a></section>
</MainLayout>